		(property "Description" "6-pin 2.54 mm vertical through-hole pin header (DNP). Exposes the ESP32-C6 native USB-Serial-JTAG D-/D+ pair (GPIO 12/13) plus EN (chip enable / reset) and BOOT strap (GPIO 9) on solder pads at the C3 case-wall opening. Used only for emergency recovery flashing — the production OAS unit flashes via OTA after first commission. Pinout: 1=GND, 2=+3V3, 3=USB_DM, 4=USB_DP, 5=EN, 6=BOOT."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
